
================================================================
## 1. Create the project directory tree in HDFS
================================================================
$ hdfs dfs -mkdir -p /ghcn/raw /ghcn/stations /ghcn/countries /ghcn/output

================================================================
## 2. Upload the raw yearly files (decompressed on the fly so HDFS can split them into 32 MB blocks)
================================================================
/ghcn/raw/2023.csv already present - skipping upload
/ghcn/raw/2024.csv already present - skipping upload
/ghcn/raw/2025.csv already present - skipping upload

================================================================
## 3. Upload station and country metadata
================================================================
$ hdfs dfs -put -f data/stations.tsv /ghcn/stations/stations.tsv
$ hdfs dfs -put -f data/countries.tsv /ghcn/countries/countries.tsv

================================================================
## 4. List everything recursively
================================================================
$ hdfs dfs -ls -R /ghcn
drwxr-xr-x   - root supergroup          0 2026-10-27 05:02 /ghcn/countries
-rw-r--r--   2 root supergroup       3488 2026-10-27 05:02 /ghcn/countries/countries.tsv
drwxr-xr-x   - root supergroup          0 2026-10-27 04:57 /ghcn/output
drwxr-xr-x   - root supergroup          0 2026-10-27 05:01 /ghcn/raw
-rw-r--r--   2 root supergroup 1376338331 2026-10-27 04:57 /ghcn/raw/2023.csv
-rw-r--r--   2 root supergroup 1383355743 2026-10-27 04:59 /ghcn/raw/2024.csv
-rw-r--r--   2 root supergroup 1310928099 2026-10-27 05:01 /ghcn/raw/2025.csv
drwxr-xr-x   - root supergroup          0 2026-10-27 05:02 /ghcn/stations
-rw-r--r--   2 root supergroup    9225470 2026-10-27 05:02 /ghcn/stations/stations.tsv

================================================================
## 5. Space used (logical size, then size including both replicas)
================================================================
$ hdfs dfs -du -h /ghcn
3.4 K  6.8 K   /ghcn/countries
0      0       /ghcn/output
3.8 G  7.6 G   /ghcn/raw
8.8 M  17.6 M  /ghcn/stations
$ hdfs dfs -du -s -h /ghcn/raw
3.8 G  7.6 G  /ghcn/raw

